Input: Downsample Resolution l,
    New Point to Insert p,
    Switch of Parallely Re-building SW

1 Algorithm Start
2  \( C_{D} \leftarrow \)  FindCube(l,p)
3  \( p_{center} \leftarrow \)  Center( \( C_{D} \) );
4  \( V \leftarrow \)  BoxwiseSearch(RootNode, \( C_{D} \) );
5  \( V.push(p) \) ;
6  \( p_{nearest} \leftarrow \)  FindNearest(V, \( p_{center} \) );
7 BoxwiseDelete(RootNode, \( C_{D} \) )
8 Insert(RootNode, \( p_{nearest} \) , NULL,SW);
9 Algorithm End
